    requirement: "Hand-written Rust added inside the generated stage0 mirror must carry a checkable receipt -- a deleted scaffold path, a before/after seed census, or a deferral naming a lane and a tracking row (ctrl review policy). #16156 added about 345 lines of hand-written witness Rust at src/v1/stage0/src/cli_run/demanded_typecheck_equivalence.rs (the declaration-grain tests: inactive grain equals #16069, unreached stays unseen, reachable errors still refuse, out-of-set reads refuse typed, alias-body and provider-row reachability, the corpus witness). This row is the deferral: the witnesses are owed a landing -- rewritten as generated .dag test sources under the corpus, or admitted as a standing hand-written exception with a file-level receipt -- and the lane that decides and executes it is follow-up node adhoc-0eedbb6e-a35, the same node named by gunbc.design_ruling::run_realizes_only_demanded_declarations for enrolling the by-hand demanded_scope controls.",
    standing: RequirementEstablished {
